stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> RECEIVED
    RECEIVED --> STORED: raw_events written
    STORED --> ADAPTING
    ADAPTING --> MAPPING: ProviderDraft ok
    ADAPTING --> ADAPTER_FAILED: unparseable
    MAPPING --> VALIDATING: canonical draft ok
    MAPPING --> MAPPING_FAILED: no/failed profile
    VALIDATING --> DEDUPING: schema + rules ok
    VALIDATING --> INVALID: failed rules
    DEDUPING --> LEAD_UPSERT: new / merge / link
    DEDUPING --> NEEDS_REVIEW: ambiguous
    LEAD_UPSERT --> LEAD_UPSERT_RETRY: transient error
    LEAD_UPSERT_RETRY --> LEAD_UPSERT: backoff
    LEAD_UPSERT_RETRY --> DEAD_LETTER: attempts exhausted
    LEAD_UPSERT --> EMITTED: outbox LeadCreated/Updated
    EMITTED --> DONE

    ADAPTER_FAILED --> DEAD_LETTER
    MAPPING_FAILED --> DEAD_LETTER
    INVALID --> DEAD_LETTER

    NEEDS_REVIEW --> DEDUPING: manual resolve
    DEAD_LETTER --> STORED: replay from raw
    DEAD_LETTER --> DISCARDED: discard (audited)

    DONE --> [*]
    DISCARDED --> [*]
